                        "submissionMethodDetails": "UKSA is using the Jaggaer eSourcing Portal for this procurement.\n**DO NOT apply directly to the buyer. All tender information MUST be submitted through the portal.**\nPlease review all attached information to ensure a full understanding of this requirement. All attachments can be found in the Supplier Attachments tab within the Jaggaer eSourcing Portal.\nTo register on the Jaggaer eSourcing portal please use the link https://beisgroup.ukp.app.jaggaer.com/ and follow the instructions to register as a supplier.\nIf you are already registered on the Jaggaer eSourcing Portal and wish to participate in this procurement, please use the link: https://beisgroup.ukp.app.jaggaer.com/ Once you are logged into the system, you will be able to locate the Procurement you wish to leave a bid on by clicking the ITTs Open to All Suppliers and searching for '\nIn-Orbit Manufacturing (IOM) Maturation Research & Development Projects'.\nAlternatively, follow this link to the ITT: https://beisgroup.ukp.app.jaggaer.com/go/2444611401A19393C4EE\nApplications will close at 13:00 (UK time) on 27th November 2026. It will not be possible to submit applications beyond this deadline.",
